[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0174","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0174.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0423","title":"Sun Solaris ipcs 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 7/8 系统中的 ipcs 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，由于未对 TZ（时区）环境变量进行长度检查，本地攻击者可通过设置超长的 TZ 环境变量触发缓冲区溢出，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Solaris 7 x86 及 Solaris 8 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，成功利用后可完全控制目标系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0423"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:16.907","remediation":"立即升级至 Oracle Solaris 11.4 或更高版本（Solaris 7/8 已停止支持，不再提供安全更新）。如无法升级，可设置内核参数 `noexec_user_stack=1` 并限制本地用户登录，同时通过 `tzsetup` 或环境变量过滤脚本限制 TZ 变量长度不超过 256 字节作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0217.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2581","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6369","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20751","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0423.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0423","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0423.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0423.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3d9b98ec1f95daa3c88d7a8990ea8f5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-23p6-gh9w-qhrf/GHSA-23p6-gh9w-qhrf.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0093.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151100_151200.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--16ff0e60-2057-4fe7-8559-0eeb536c958a.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0174.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0173","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0173.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0422","title":"Oracle Solaris Xsun HOME 环境变量缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 操作系统中的 Xsun 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。Xsun 是 Solaris 下的 X Window System 服务器实现，在处理 HOME 环境变量时未正确检查长度边界，本地攻击者可通过设置超长的 HOME 环境变量并触发 Xsun 执行，导致栈缓冲区溢出。攻击者利用此漏洞可覆盖返回地址，以 root 权限执行任意代码，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 Solaris 8 及更早版本，需要本地系统访问权限，无需用户交互。已存在公开可利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0422"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:16.800","remediation":"Solaris 8 用户安装补丁 108652（SPARC）/108653（x86），Solaris 7 安装 106942（SPARC）/106943（x86），Solaris 2.6 安装 105565（SPARC）/105566（x86）。上述版本均已停止支持，建议升级至 Solaris 11。临时缓解措施：限制 Xsun 二进制文件执行权限，仅允许可信用户执行 `/usr/openwin/bin/Xsun`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0158.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2561","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6343","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A555","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20743","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0422.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0422","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0422.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0422.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3d9b98ec1f95daa3c88d7a8990ea8f5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6cj3-4wq8-r2m5/GHSA-6cj3-4wq8-r2m5.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c6342b1d-b318-4acc-865c-65c7eddb84ea.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0422.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0173.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0172","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0172.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0421","title":"Sun Solaris FTP 服务器敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"Solaris 8 及之前版本的 FTP 服务器存在内核转储漏洞。本地或远程攻击者可通过发送包含有效用户名及错误密码的认证请求，随后执行 CWD ~ 命令触发 FTP 服务产生内核转储文件（core dump），该文件默认存储于根目录且权限可能为世界可读。攻击者可借此获取其中包含的 shadow 密码等敏感信息，或填满磁盘分区造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程触发，影响 Solaris 2.6/7/8 等版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0421"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:16.683","remediation":"建议立即安装 Sun 安全补丁 110646-01 (Solaris 8) 或 108809-01 (Solaris 2.6)，可通过 sunsolve.sun.com 获取。如无法打补丁，可在 /etc/ftpd/ftpaccess 中限制匿名用户权限，或在 inetd.conf 中注释 ftp 行并重启 inetd 以禁用 FTP 服务作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/177200","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2601","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20764","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0421.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0421","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0421.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0421.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/solaris7_110646.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3d9b98ec1f95daa3c88d7a8990ea8f5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8fjp-x7fp-72f8/GHSA-8fjp-x7fp-72f8.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/solaris8_111606.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0421.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2601/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0172.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0171","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0171.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0419","title":"Oracle Application Server ndwfn4.so 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Oracle Application Server 4.0.8.2 中 iPlanet Web Server (iWS) 4.1 的共享库 ndwfn4.so 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向应用服务器发送特制的超长 HTTP 请求（如 /jsp/ 路径）触发该漏洞，导致任意命令执行。攻击无需身份认证，仅需网络访问即可利用，危害严重。受影响版本包括 Oracle Application Server 4.0.8.2 及配套的 iPlanet Web Server 4.1。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0419"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:16.467","remediation":"升级 Oracle Application Server 至 4.0.8.2 以上补丁版本，或迁移至 Oracle AS 10g (9.0.4) 及以上版本。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器层面配置请求 URI 长度限制（如 LimitRequestLine 4096），并禁用不必要的 JSP 处理模块 ndwfn4.so。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98692227816141&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2569","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20747","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0419.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0419","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0419.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0419.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jrrq-72m7-2wjr/GHSA-jrrq-72m7-2wjr.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/0xxx/cve-2001-0419.yaml","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/O/oas_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151100_151200.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0171.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0170","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0170.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0418","title":"NCM Content Management System content.pl SQL注入漏洞","description":"NCM Content Management System 中的 content.pl 脚本未对 id 参数进行有效过滤，存在 SQL 注入漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向 id 参数插入特制 SQL 语句，实现对内容数据库的任意数据读取，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，仅需构造恶意 HTTP 请求即可触发，ExploitDB 上已有公开利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0418"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:16.360","remediation":"该产品已停止维护，无官方补丁。建议立即将 content.pl 脚本中 id 参数改为整数类型检查（如 `/^\\\\d+$/`），并对所有用户输入使用参数化查询或 prepared statement 替代字符串拼接。部署 Web 应用防火墙 (WAF) 拦截包含 SQL 特征的请求。考虑迁移至受支持的 CMS 平台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0223.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2584","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20752","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0418.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0418","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0418.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0418.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vh6h-588x-ph4v/GHSA-vh6h-588x-ph4v.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2584/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0418.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2c45af9e-29de-4053-ba83-7c395d376f86.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0170.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0166","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0166.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0406","title":"Samba 2.0.x 不安全临时文件符号链接攻击本地文件覆盖漏洞","description":"Samba 2.2.0 之前版本存在不安全的临时文件符号链接漏洞。本地攻击者可通过打印机队列查询、smbclient 中的 more 命令或 mput 命令，利用符号链接攻击将临时文件重定向到任意系统文件，从而覆盖目标文件内容。该漏洞需要攻击者拥有本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。建议升级至 Samba 2.2.0 或更高版本以修复此问题。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0406"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-07-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:14.870","remediation":"升级 Samba 至 2.2.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了打印机队列查询及 smbclient 中 more/mput 命令的符号链接检查机制。如无法升级，限制本地用户对 /tmp 目录的写权限，并禁用 smbclient 的 mput/more 命令作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0305.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0319.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0326.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2001-04/0608.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000395","http://www.caldera.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-015.0.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-048","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/670568","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-040.php3","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2617","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20776","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0406.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc