块（rmmod ip_conntrack_ftp），或配置 iptables 规则限制 RELATED 状态连接仅允许可信源地址。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0271.html","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-071.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-052.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-084.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2602","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6390","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20765","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0405.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0405","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0405.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0405.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qphq-fjvj-6855/GHSA-qphq-fjvj-6855.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a2df4aab-5ea6-487d-b324-0335e2c28ece.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0405.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2001-071.nasl","https://github.com/shamedgh/confine/blob/a75dad3ad336e6258a42cd1ce4af061eea68ed76/cve.files/cveToFile.json.type.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0165.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0159","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0159.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0390","title":"IBM WebSphere Application Server macro.d2w 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"IBM WebSphere Application Server / Net.Commerce 3 3.1.2 及之前版本中存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可直接向 CGI-BIN 目录下的 macro.d2w 脚本发送大量 %0a（换行符）组成的超长字符串，触发该脚本处理异常，导致目标服务因资源耗尽而崩溃或无法响应正常请求。该漏洞影响 IBM WebSphere Application Server 3.x 及 Net.Commerce 3 系列版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0390"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:13.063","remediation":"升级 IBM WebSphere Application Server 至 3.5 及以上版本，或迁移至受支持的 WebSphere 版本。临时缓解措施：在 Web 服务器层面限制对 /cgi-bin/macro.d2w 路径的访问，或移除该 CGI 脚本文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/176100","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2588","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20753","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0390.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0390","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0390.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0390.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p6p2-rcmv-fx7v/GHSA-p6p2-rcmv-fx7v.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/middle/IBM%20Websphere_Net.Commerce%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%8Fmacro.d2w%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1(CVE-2001-0390).html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151100_151200.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--509df056-0aa8-4571-8dee-131ecc911199.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2588/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0159.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0158","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0158.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0386","title":"AnalogX SimpleServer:WWW AUX 目录拒绝服务漏洞","description":"AnalogX SimpleServer:WWW 1.08 及之前版本中存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者通过向目标服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求访问 /aux 目录（Windows 保留设备名称），可触发系统设备名称解析异常，导致服务进程崩溃或停止响应。该漏洞利用难度低，无需身份认证，攻击者仅需构造恶意 HTTP 请求即可实施攻击，严重影响服务可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0386"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:12.590","remediation":"升级至 AnalogX SimpleServer:WWW 1.09 或更高版本（如仍能获取），该版本已修复 /aux 路径导致的拒绝服务问题。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至仍在维护的 Web 服务器（如 Apache HTTP Server、Nginx 或 IIS）。若短期内无法替换，可在反向代理或防火墙层配置规则，拦截包含 \"/aux\" 路径的 HTTP 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/3781","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/177156","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2608","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6395","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20771","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0386.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0386","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0386.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/459118