具存在竞争条件漏洞。当 ppd 以 -T 选项运行时，会在 /tmp 目录下创建不安全的临时文件 ppd.trace，未对文件路径进行原子化检查。本地攻击者可通过预先创建符号链接指向目标系统文件，利用时间窗口诱导程序以特权身份覆写任意文件，导致系统文件完整性受损或权限提升。该漏洞攻击复杂度较低，但需本地访问权限。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0384"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:12.370","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止支持的 Siemens Reliant UNIX 5.4，厂商已不再提供安全更新。建议立即升级至受支持的操作系统（如现代 Linux 发行版）。临时缓解措施：移除 ppd 程序的 setuid/setgid 权限（`chmod u-s /usr/bin/ppd`），并限制仅受信用户可本地登录系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/176709","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2606","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20769","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0384.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0384","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0384.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0384.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8377-ghcg-3gw2/GHSA-8377-ghcg-3gw2.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2606/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0384.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8edfd27a-6917-4f49-86a5-ba126c2d091a.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0156.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0156.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0156.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0102","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0102.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0262","title":"Netscape SmartDownload 1.3 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Netscape SmartDownload 1.3 存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过构造恶意网页并诱导用户访问，向该组件提交超长 URL 参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Netscape SmartDownload 1.3 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议用户升级至最新版本或停止使用该组件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0262"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:59.167","remediation":"Netscape SmartDownload 1.3 及其依赖的 Netscape 浏览器已停止维护超过 20 年，官方不再提供安全补丁。建议立即卸载 Netscape SmartDownload 组件并升级至 Mozilla Firefox、Google Chrome 等现代浏览器。作为临时缓解措施，避免使用旧版 Netscape 浏览器访问不可信网站，并在浏览器安全设置中禁用自动下载执行插件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2001/a041301-1.txt","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20775","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0262.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0262","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0262.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0262.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8cj5-765m-4mc8/GHSA-8cj5-765m-4mc8.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0262.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2615/info.html","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0102.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0102.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0102.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0096","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0096.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0239","title":"Microsoft ISA Server 2000 Web Proxy 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Security and Acceleration (ISA) Server 2000 的 Web 代理组件存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送特制的超长 Web 请求触发该漏洞，导致 Web 代理服务崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 ISA Server 2000 所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。受影响的系统需要安装安全更新或限制可提交的请求长度以缓解风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0239"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:56.570","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS01-016 提供的补丁程序，或升级至 ISA Server 2000 Service Pack 1 及以上版本。也可在 ISA Server 管理控制台中，配置 Web 请求筛选规则，限制单次请求的最大 URL 长度以缓解攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/l-073.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/176912","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/177160","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/179986","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2600","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-021","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6383","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20763","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0239.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0239","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0239.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0239.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7rq7-3vr3-7mmq/GHSA-7rq7-3vr3-7mmq.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0239.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f517c841-900f-4cf6-b609-2d2d28289cdb.json","https://github.com/CERTCC/SBOM/blob/ae581e32992458f65018df4eced684b7370bba39/SwiftBOM/cpe_lookup/cve_lookup/microsoft/isa_server_cve.json","https://github.com/deshalit/async_prog/blob/2a58e64a10a9fe3859356f4b80fc7f40a4683d0c/08/app/startup_db.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0096.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0096.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0096.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0161","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0161.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0400","title":"nph-maillist CGI 邮件列表管理脚本 email address 参数 shell 元字符注入漏洞","description":"nph-maillist CGI 脚本（3.0/3.5 版本）对用户提交的电子邮件地址未做任何过滤处理，攻击者可在 email 字段中插入反引号等 shell 元字符，导致任意操作系统命令被注入并执行。未经身份认证的远程攻击者仅需构造恶意 HTTP 请求即可利用此漏洞，完全控制目标 Web 服务器。该漏洞利用难度低、影响严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0400"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-02","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"立即升级 nph-maillist 至 3.5.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复邮件地址字段中反引号等 shell 元字符的过滤缺陷。如厂商已停止维护，建议彻底移除 nph-maillist 组件，改用受支持的邮件列表软件（如 Mailman 3），并在 Web 服务器层面对 CGI 目录禁用特殊字符传递作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/175506","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2563","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20744","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/56b9e9b42ce0a91a448094549973b81cdf8e832e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0400.json"],"poc_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20744"],"exp_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20744"],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0161.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0161.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0161.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0381","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0381.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1246","title":"PHP mail() 函数命令注入漏洞","description":"PHP 4.0.5 至 4.1.0 版本在安全模式下，mail() 函数的第5个参数无法正确过滤用户输入中的 shell 元字符，导致攻击者可通过向该参数注入 shell 命令来执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响使用安全模式的 PHP 4.x 系统，攻击者可借此在目标服务器上执行 malicious 代码。攻击条件为目标系统启用了 PHP 安全模式且 mail() 函数接收未经过 proper 过滤的第5个参数。利用方式是构造包含 shell 命令的邮件参数并调用 mail() 函数，即可触发命令执行漏洞，导致服务器安全受损。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1246"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-06-30T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:53.293","remediation":"建议立即升级至 PHP 4.1.1 或更高版本（建议升级至 PHP 4.2.0+ 彻底移除 safe_mode）。无法升级时，在 php.ini 中设置 disable_functions = mail 禁用 mail() 函数，或设置 safe_mode = Off 关闭安全模式。临时缓解可在 Web 服务器层面（如 Apache httpd.conf）限制 mail() 第 5 参数传递，或使用 mod_security 规则拦截包含 shell 元字符的 mail() 调用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/194425","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/6787.php","http://www.php.net/do_download.php?download_file=php-4.1.2.tar.gz","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-102.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-129.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-159.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2954","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20985","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1246.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1246","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1246.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1246.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7pf5-hfgr-ch72/GHSA-7pf5-hfgr-ch72.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2002-129.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-1246.md","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/1xxx/cve-2001-1246.yaml","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mandrake_MDKSA-2002-059.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_0_100.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vuln